<title>UK: SOCCER-LIVERPOOL V PARIS ST GERMAIN TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LIVERPOOL V PARIS ST GERMAIN TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>LIVERPOOL 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for Thursday night's</p>
<p>European Cup Winners Cup semifinal second leg between Liverpool</p>
<p>and Paris St Germain at Anfield:</p>
<p>Liverpool: 1-David James; 20-Stig Inge Bjornebye, 5-Mark</p>
<p>Wright, 14-Neil Ruddock, 4-Jason McAteer, 7-Steve McManaman,</p>
<p>11-Jamie Redknapp, 16-Michael Thomas, 9-Robbie Fowler, 8-Stan</p>
<p>Collymore, 15-Patrik Berger</p>
<p>Paris St Germain: 1-Bernard Lama; 4-Bruno N'Gotty,</p>
<p>13-Laurent Fournier, 17-Jimmy Algerino, 6-Paul Le Guen,</p>
<p>19-Jerome Leroy, 15-Benoit Cauet, 8-Vincent Guerin, 7-Leonardo,</p>
<p>10-Rai, 11-Patrice Loko</p>
<p>Referee: Rune Pedersen</p>
</text>
